BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (actual billable clock. A 90-120-second buffer describes a contract, not permission to keep callers trapped in an IVR.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (Measure time to buyer answer separately from time after buyer connection; hold music and exchange announcements) Tj ET
