BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (and buyer receipt together. When duration-qualified calls systematically fail acceptance, inspect that clock boundary) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (before blaming source quality. Never manufacture silence, loops, or coached conversations to stretch calls past the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (threshold. Those tactics convert a routing defect into deliberate billing abuse and give buyers a reason to terminate) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (every related publisher relationship, not merely reject one call.) Tj ET
