BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 411.50 Tm (learn from reversals labeled as successful sales.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 396.27 Tm (The sixth trap is scaling paid search using a blended account average. At $12 CPC and a 25% click-to-call rate,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 381.05 Tm (acquisition cost is $48 per call. With 70% acceptance and an $80 payout, expected gross revenue is $56 per acquired) Tj ET
