BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 335.37 Tm (by $53, or $13.25. Build bid ceilings by keyword, device, hour, geography, and buyer availability; do not let profitable) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 320.15 Tm (emergency plumbing subsidize unqualified insurance calls inside one blended conversion goal. Pause the illustrative) Tj ET
